WEBVTT

00:04.600 --> 00:08.500
At that very instant, a violent tempest swept across the palace courtyards.

00:09.080 --> 00:15.000
The grand plaque of Taiji Hall was torn loose by the gale, crashing down directly before your feet!

00:17.880 --> 00:26.000
Seizing the divine omen, you hoisted the imperial plaque aloft, shouting to the skies: "Heaven's Mandate resides with me! Cast down your weapons and surrender at once!"

00:25.720 --> 00:27.500
Kill!

00:27.640 --> 00:32.400
That roar not only sent your troops' morale soaring, but struck deep terror into the royal defenders.

00:32.520 --> 00:43.000
Driven to the edge, you fought with peerless heroism, shattered the encirclement, and mounted the dragon throne! You invested Chen Wan'er as Lady Chen, and proclaimed the new era 'Tianming'.

00:44.560 --> 00:52.500
Knowing that your throne was seized by force, your guilt weighed heavily upon you. You threw yourself into statecraft from dusk till dawn, striving to redeem your past sins.

00:52.360 --> 00:57.800
With the virtuous Empress Xie administering internal affairs and Lady Chen serving as female Chancellor at your side,

00:58.400 --> 01:05.000
stellar ministers and invincible commanders flocked to your banner. Marshal the entire realm's might, your northern expedition cleaved forward like bamboo before the blade!

01:04.880 --> 01:09.500
In the 7th year of Tianming, Sikong Yao personally led the imperial legions to retake Yong'an.

01:09.360 --> 01:18.500
The Wutu had marshaled a hundred thousand warriors to sever his retreat, when unexpectedly, a meteorite fell from the heavens and struck the Wutu main camp!

01:18.840 --> 01:25.500
The barbarian hordes dissolved in total rout. General Shi Lang of the Wutu cried out: "This is truly the Mandate of Heaven!"

01:26.040 --> 01:29.500
and drew his blade across his own throat.

01:31.800 --> 01:40.000
By the 10th year of Tianming, every inch of lost northern homeland was reclaimed, and neighboring realms paid homage as vassals.

01:42.560 --> 01:47.000
In the 29th year of Tianming, Sikong Yao passed into eternity after consuming longevity elixirs.

01:47.240 --> 01:54.000
Because his accession was tainted by usurpation, historians fiercely disputed his legacy, ultimately posthumously honoring him as Emperor Xuanlie.

01:54.400 --> 02:02.000
Yet among the common folk, another legend was cherished even more: that he was the Chosen One of Heaven.
